  "prefLabel": "Rev 3201.06 Program year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3201.06 “Program year” means “program year” as defined in RSA 77-G:1, XII, namely “the year beginning July 1 and ending June 30.”\n\nSource. #10236, eff 11-28-12; ss by #12881, eff 9-27-19; ss by #13462, eff 10-13-22 (formerly Rev 3201.05) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 3200)",
